meta {
  name: Phase02-Photos
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  One unique high-quality real-estate photo per seeded listing (8 multipart
  uploads → R2). Run `photos/download-photos.sh` first to populate the
  local image files.

  ⚠️ NOT idempotent — each run uploads a fresh photo and appends a new row
  to `listing_photos`. Re-running produces duplicates per listing.
}
